        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABOUT THE GAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938030/extras/899658e3ec279a3c9c534a31dbc1615b.avif?t=1765373900\" width=1438 height=810 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you can't turn to the law, you need a friend. A friend that's willing to get down, dirty, &amp; even dumb. You need, DUD. Yes, DUD! A comedy point&amp;click adventure for gamers of all levels and ages spiced with whacky humor and terribly good soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Darwin Jr. has hired you to recover his late father's stolen will. The main suspect is country club priss Charles Cadbury, but the large and intimidating Spike is shown making the theft. DUD isn't a superstar, but he's willing to do anything to crack the case.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A CUNNING DETECTIVE?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Being a master of disguises, Dud sneaks into places under fake identities. Whether he’s gathering information or taking something that belongs to the bad guy, he’s up to the task. A nice guy willing to take on any situation. If he’s going to get paid, there’s a lot of whacky things he has to do, to come through.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938030/extras/9d22fb144a59ea3d45964f1a73adefb1.avif?t=1765373900\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938030/extras_big/9d22fb144a59ea3d45964f1a73adefb1.avif?t=1765373900 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABOUT THE GAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938030/extras/899658e3ec279a3c9c534a31dbc1615b.avif?t=1765373900\" width=1438 height=810 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you can't turn to the law, you need a friend. A friend that's willing to get down, dirty, &amp; even dumb. You need, DUD. Yes, DUD! A comedy point&amp;click adventure for gamers of all levels and ages spiced with whacky humor and terribly good soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Darwin Jr. has hired you to recover his late father's stolen will. The main suspect is country club priss Charles Cadbury, but the large and intimidating Spike is shown making the theft. DUD isn't a superstar, but he's willing to do anything to crack the case.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A CUNNING DETECTIVE?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Being a master of disguises, Dud sneaks into places under fake identities. Whether he’s gathering information or taking something that belongs to the bad guy, he’s up to the task. A nice guy willing to take on any situation. If he’s going to get paid, there’s a lot of whacky things he has to do, to come through.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938030/extras/9d22fb144a59ea3d45964f1a73adefb1.avif?t=1765373900\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938030/extras_big/9d22fb144a59ea3d45964f1a73adefb1.avif?t=1765373900 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>",
        "short_description": "When trouble strikes, they hire DUD &amp; when they hire DUD, things get nuts! Do you have what it takes to be in DUD's shoes? Sure, you do. So get down &amp; dirty &amp; play this point&amp;click adventure game today. Sneak your your way in and out of trouble of recovering the stolen will.",
